{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ead326dc81e3b8263d3aa974614a5e5d48514fd5125283fb598caaf5a606383b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fe8b7b63fbb8b5b2b765134640cce0fc3f728f0b2552ff310d85d8eb936ac35",
      "text": "世界上独一无二的生日咖喱",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12913a74fc568fa6eabd579ff8cb95049a985c1692cd65c47ac42eb5d61aff11",
      "text": "马上就到冬马的生日了。\n翔太和北斗计划在派对上为冬马\n亲手制作咖喱。而冬马虽然\n没有察觉到两人的心思，\n却对咖喱的香气敏锐地捕捉到了……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:322c9024d472aea6e6b84a20e5063d2eeb4fd81241d667edaa0c2ddcb5d65283",
      "text": "嗯……嗯嗯！\n今天的咖喱感觉超棒。\n可以说是至今为止最棒的一次了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f17fc70afbb66bd2e02ffc8e15052244111c83c99818bb0797712bfddb11b617",
      "text": "呵呵，你果然也这么觉得？\n虽然我本来就很有信心，\n不过翔太都这么说了那就准没错呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e113867d826035d1c716b1dea28767b6b79c6d38757a38706ac8ac52137929c4",
      "text": "吃到这么美味的咖喱，\n冬马君肯定会吓一跳的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8b3d0e84ffd67cad121e77bd734967abf670e74cf84d2a34e98d1c69fe80e23",
      "text": "嗯。真让人期待呢。\n好了，我去休息室把桌子布置一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:451e4cfc1b965de2c4611df67955bae4269d7d57b5c33827c460e01cdac44d24",
      "text": "好～的。唔～我稍微休息一下好了～\n在派对开始前得养精蓄锐才行♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f89e0e0bf6f433d55f9519ff8b19b1ee094aac7e9c4b79bde507a741a505d286",
      "text": "咖喱和蛋糕，\n他有开心收下吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33181d03a29df748e2fc11dc61c4039661e05b5896df63181aac916451a15ce8",
      "text": "嗯，是最棒的礼物了。\n真没想到你们居然为了我，\n准备得这么周全……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49c02ec515fe8ae177ddec1e10408eff55aaa8198017bd2c8cb729518df19177",
      "text": "太好了。不过，其实除了吃的之外，\n我们还准备了另一份礼物哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1163cef7f1ddb7fc2d694cc6e70015d0f29b0dfcf7f0a1c948d662e2de27673",
      "text": "是这样吗！？\n根本不用这么费心的啦……\n谢谢你们啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57ebaf1d2b34e8e02a33364cd67e93d4e2018f5e1d179d8301370f684bcf8f7d",
      "text": "并不是费心啦。\n只要一想到冬马开心的样子，\n我和翔太就不自觉地干劲满满了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be473daa6caaf7f0ffa2b74862e63cc5b659686d66b658d24831db5fa8b7242b",
      "text": "啊～真好吃呢。\n比起冬马君平时吃的咖喱感觉怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cc1a8a00b1ac11747a27e6d6b2db0489870dae0faab9ac10a19b54eea712c02",
      "text": "看似相似，醇厚和深度却完全不一样……\n可恶，好想知道秘密调味料是什么。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12ee6730b35b9a8a2e66485ef5fde7f383e61f63390725e490d4de3fa43eb4c0",
      "text": "嘿嘿，这可是秘密呢。\n不过又有点想念冬马君做的咖喱了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:619f873d1eb4eb0e38acbe590180019cd33dfed360882b924e44f5dfe8ec9e85",
      "text": "刚才不是才猛吃了那么一大顿吗……\n算了，想吃我做的随时都能给你做啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12:cmd-000160:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c13f2b2774a9b6de6fd4f377897c3731c113033d169a1737514c88fc32f0370e",
      "text": "真不愧是冬马君！\n好期待哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
